      alternative('c',
        '| 数列 | 前5项 |\n| --- | --- |\n| $(p_n)$ | $1,\\ 2,\\ 3,\\ 4,\\ 5$ |\n| $(q_n)$ | $7,\\ 4,\\ 1,\\ -2,\\ -5$ |',
        'correct', 'Include each initial term, then apply four additions of 1 to p and four subtractions of 3 to q.'),
