  question(
    'two-cycles', '219', 'multiple',
    '数列 $(p_n)$ 和 $(q_n)$ 满足\n' +
      '$$p_1=\\frac16,\\quad p_{n+1}=-p_n;\\qquad q_1=3,\\quad q_{n+1}=\\frac1{q_n},$$\n' +
      '其中 $n=1,2,3,\\ldots$。选择所有正确给出相应数列前5项的选项。',
    'Construct complete early-term cycles for negation and reciprocation, preserving magnitude or reciprocal pairing.',
    `${source('219').subtasks[4].independent_derivation}\n${source('219').subtasks[5].independent_derivation}`,
    'Multiple selection compares two distinct self-inverse updates through complete five-term rows. Each row must respect every transition; the task is not one response per sign or fraction.',
    [prefixLoss],
    ['a', 'd'],
    [
      alternative('a', '$(p_n)$：$\\frac16,\\ -\\frac16,\\ \\frac16,\\ -\\frac16,\\ \\frac16$。',
        'correct', 'Repeated negation alternates the sign and keeps the magnitude 1/6 unchanged.'),
      alternative('b', '$(q_n)$：$3,\\ 1,\\ \\frac13,\\ \\frac19,\\ \\frac1{27}$。',
        'incorrect', 'Replace taking the reciprocal of the current term with dividing the current term by the initial value 3: 3/3=1, then 1/3,1/9,1/27.',
        'Treat reciprocal formation as repeated scaling by 1/3 rather than applying 1/q_n.'),
      alternative('c', '$(p_n)$：$\\frac16,\\ -6,\\ \\frac16,\\ -6,\\ \\frac16$。',
        'incorrect', 'Read -p_n as -1/p_n: -(1/(1/6))=-6, then -(1/(-6))=1/6; the mistaken negative-reciprocal update repeats.',
        'Insert a reciprocal into the negation rule.'),
      alternative('d', '$(q_n)$：$3,\\ \\frac13,\\ 3,\\ \\frac13,\\ 3$。',
