    ]
  ),
  question(
    'two-step-difference', '220', 'single',
    '数列 $(c_n)$ 满足\n' +
      '$$c_1=13,\\quad c_2=6,\\quad c_{n+2}=c_n-c_{n+1}\\quad(n=1,2,3,\\ldots).$$\n' +
      '哪个选项正确给出这个数列的前8项？',
    'Construct a complete prefix of an order-two subtraction recurrence, preserving operand order and negative values.',
    source('220').subtasks[1].independent_derivation,
    'Subtraction is not commutative, unlike the other order-two recurrence. One complete eight-term row captures the older-minus-newer order and the consequences of subtracting negative terms.',
