    ['b'],
    [
      alternative('a', '$13,\\ 6,\\ -7,\\ -13,\\ -6,\\ 7,\\ 13,\\ 6$。',
        'incorrect', 'Reverse the subtraction to c_(n+2)=c_(n+1)-c_n: 6-13=-7, -7-6=-13, -13-(-7)=-6, -6-(-13)=7, 7-(-6)=13, 13-7=6.',
        'Subtract the older term from the newer term instead of the newer from the older.'),
      alternative('b', '$13,\\ 6,\\ 7,\\ -1,\\ 8,\\ -9,\\ 17,\\ -26$。',
        'correct', 'Compute older minus newer in a moving pair: 13-6=7, 6-7=-1, 7-(-1)=8, -1-8=-9, 8-(-9)=17, -9-17=-26.'),
      alternative('c', '$13,\\ 6,\\ 7,\\ 1,\\ 6,\\ 5,\\ 1,\\ 4$。',
        'incorrect', 'Use absolute differences: |13-6|=7, |6-7|=1, |7-1|=6, |1-6|=5, |6-5|=1, |5-1|=4.',
        'Force each difference to be nonnegative by inserting an absolute value.'),
      alternative('d', '$13,\\ 6,\\ 19,\\ 25,\\ 44,\\ 69,\\ 113,\\ 182$。',
        'incorrect', 'Use addition instead: 13+6=19, 6+19=25, 19+25=44, 25+44=69, 44+69=113, 69+113=182.',
        'Apply the two-term addition recurrence in place of the stated difference recurrence.')
    ]
  ),
  question(
    'prefix-and-formula', '221', 'multiple',
    '四个数列的条件如下，所有下标均从1开始，递推式对整数 $n\\ge1$ 成立。\n\n' +
      '| 数列 | 第1项 | 递推式 |\n' +
      '| --- | --- | --- |\n' +
      '| $(p_n)$ | $p_1=10$ | $p_{n+1}=p_n+10$ |\n' +
