      alternative('b', '$(q_n)$：前5项为 $10,\\ 20,\\ 30,\\ 40,\\ 50$；通项为 $q_n=10n$。',
        'incorrect', 'Replace q_(n+1)=10q_n by q_(n+1)=q_n+10. Starting at 10 gives the displayed arithmetic prefix and q_n=10+10(n-1)=10n.',
        'Treat multiplying by 10 as adding 10 when extending the sequence and deriving its formula.'),
      alternative('c', '$(r_n)$：前5项为 $2,\\ 4,\\ 8,\\ 16,\\ 32$；通项为 $r_n=2^n$。',
