        'incorrect', 'For I, correctly factor (y-5)(y+11)=0 but retain only y=5, giving x=8 and the singleton set. For II, the shared factor gives y=3,x=16/3.',
        'Discard the negative root y=-11 although the system imposes no positivity restriction.'),
      alternative('b',
        '| 方程组 | 完整解集 |\n| --- | --- |\n| I | $\\{(8,-11),(-16,5)\\}$ |\n| II | $\\{(\\frac{16}{3},3)\\}$ |',
        'incorrect', 'Obtain the separate coordinate lists x=8,-16 and y=5,-11 for I, then reverse only the y list when assembling pairs, yielding (8,-11),(-16,5). Solve II by its shared factor.',
